    <briefdescription>
<para>Traversal to collect non-local jumps. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>In particular, This sub-tree traversal begins at the given node, &apos;root&apos;, and descends to collect the following statements:</para><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>All return statements not enclosed by any function definition within &apos;root&apos;;</para></listitem><listitem><para>All break statements not enclosed by any loop or switch;</para></listitem><listitem><para>All continue statements not enclosed by any loop. </para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
